Do you have what it takes?

We are looking for a star!! Come and join the team of Rhythm Culture!

We are currently expanding and looking for some new team members to deliver Rhythm Culture West African workshops and incursions.

We provide services to schools, kindergartens and vacation care centres and we are looking for someone special to help us deliver more programs.

Team members are required to perform [Drum, Sing Dance](/early-learning-and-kindergarten-incursions/) incursions in Brisbane and the Sunshine Coast. You will need to be fit, charismatic, confident, vibrant reliable and professional.

All training and equipment is provided. Own transport is required. Previous experience in instrument, music, acting and/or dance is a bonus. Please send CV to info@rhythmculture.com.au for more information.
